{"name":"Natrolite","hex":"#ebbc71","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"natrolite","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A fibrous zeolite mineral, being a sodium aluminosilicate, of the chemical formula Na2Al2Si3O10·2H2O."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/natrolite"}],"entries":[{"title":"Natrolite","blocks":[{"text":"Natrolite is a tectosilicate mineral species belonging to the zeolite group. It is a hydrated sodium and aluminium silicate with the formula Na2Al2Si3O10·2H2O. The type locality is Hohentwiel, Hegau, Germany."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5f/Natroliteinde1.jpg/330px-Natroliteinde1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Natrolite","wikidata":"Q415318"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d2/Natrolith_Hohentwiel.jpg/500px-Natrolith_Hohentwiel.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d2/Natrolith_Hohentwiel.jpg/1280px-Natrolith_Hohentwiel.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d2/Natrolith_Hohentwiel.jpg/500px-Natrolith_Hohentwiel.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Natrolite needles from Hohentwiel (Typelocality)","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ANatrolith_Hohentwiel.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/28/Phonolith.JPG/250px-Phonolith.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/28/Phonolith.JPG/330px-Phonolith.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/28/Phonolith.JPG/250px-Phonolith.JPG?utm_source=en.wik